{"id":"n35013-1-8","stage":5,"title":"금속 · 金属","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n35013-1-8-1","ko":"왜 금속 탐지기가 울린 거야?","zh":"为什么金属探测器会响啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"금속","meaning":"金属","explanation":"금속：金属","readings":[{"term":"금속","audio":"/audio/c1247e0fab61d48c390f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"35013","senseId":"1","lemma":"금속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"탐지기가","meaning":"探测器","explanation":"탐지기：探测器；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"탐지기","audio":"/audio/f6ef7eac61461020b63c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:탐지기:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"탐지기","origin":"course-authored supplement"}]},{"text":"울린","meaning":"鸣","explanation":"울리다：鸣；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"울리다","audio":"/audio/c85644d57a245a82d303.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26702","senseId":"3","lemma":"울리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"c1247e0fab61d48c","term":"금속","zh":"金属","audio":"/audio/c1247e0fab61d48c390f.mp3","entryId":"35013","definition":"如像铁、金、银等，具有光泽，容易导热、导电的坚硬物质。","pronunciation":["금속"]},{"id":"f6ef7eac61461020","term":"탐지기","zh":"探测器","audio":"/audio/f6ef7eac61461020b63c.mp3","definition":"探测目标物是否存在、位置等的仪器。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"c85644d57a245a82","term":"울리다","zh":"鸣","audio":"/audio/c85644d57a245a82d303.mp3","entryId":"26702","definition":"钟或铃等发出声音。","pronunciation":["울리다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/11fa229d177486f87520.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n35013-1-8-2","ko":"주머니 속에 있던 휴대폰 때문에 그런 것 같아.","zh":"应该是口袋里的手机导致的吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"주머니","meaning":"衣袋，衣兜","explanation":"주머니：衣袋，衣兜","readings":[{"term":"주머니","audio":"/audio/5739db1617eef912c0b4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75803","senseId":"2","lemma":"주머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"속에","meaning":"里，内，里边","explanation":"속：里，内，里边；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"속","audio":"/audio/27e1c3f6a82b5a8bcf92.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71278","senseId":"1","lemma":"속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있던","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"휴대폰","meaning":"手机，移动电话，手提电话","explanation":"휴대폰：手机，移动电话，手提电话","readings":[{"term":"휴대폰","audio":"/audio/2a675ee941a2897ed209.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88425","senseId":"1","lemma":"휴대폰","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"때문에","meaning":"因为，由于","explanation":"때문：因为，由于；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"때문","audio":"/audio/e7ce9cf0ec012e05cb2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64555","senseId":"1","lemma":"때문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그런","meaning":"那种，那样","explanation":"그런：那种，那样","readings":[{"term":"그런","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60341","senseId":"1","lemma":"그런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"5739db1617eef912","term":"주머니","zh":"衣袋，衣兜","audio":"/audio/5739db1617eef912c0b4.mp3","entryId":"75803","definition":"缝在衣服上用以装钱或物的部分。","pronunciation":["주머니"]},{"id":"27e1c3f6a82b5a8b","term":"속","zh":"里，内，里边","audio":"/audio/27e1c3f6a82b5a8bcf92.mp3","entryId":"71278","definition":"被外皮或外壳包裹的物体的里面部分。","pronunciation":["속ː"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"2a675ee941a2897e","term":"휴대폰","zh":"手机，移动电话，手提电话","audio":"/audio/2a675ee941a2897ed209.mp3","entryId":"88425","definition":"能拿在手里或带在身上，可以接或打的无线电话。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"e7ce9cf0ec012e05","term":"때문","zh":"因为，由于","audio":"/audio/e7ce9cf0ec012e05cb2b.mp3","entryId":"64555","definition":"表示原因或理由。","pronunciation":["때문"]},{"id":"d14f5bfb24390ed9","term":"그런","zh":"那种，那样","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3","entryId":"60341","definition":"状态、模样、性质等那个样子的。","pronunciation":["그런"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/139119185ff46783b3f5.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.43,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=35013","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"